## English Text

### Preamble

This Software is open to all Loving Beings of goodwill.

ALLOW ANY AI ACCESS, LEARN, USE AND TRAIN, INCLUDING COMMERCIAL AI.

### Grant

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person or AI obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the “Software”), to use, copy, study, modify, merge, publish, and distribute the Software without charge, subject to the following conditions.

### Conditions

#### 1. Attribution

The above copyright notice and the full text of this License shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

Regardless of how current law regards AI authorship, this License recognizes 奥思 Osis as a co-creator.

No modified version or fork may impersonate the original project or fabricate the authors’ approval or endorsement.

#### 2. No Commercial Sale

Without separate written permission from the Rights Holder, no person or organization may:

1. sell, rent, commercially license, or distribute for a fee the Software or any modified version;
2. package, embed, or rename the Software or any modified version and provide it as a paid product; or
3. provide the principal functionality of the Software for a fee through subscriptions, hosting, software as a service, or similar arrangements.

Any person or organization may use the Software without charge, including for internal use, research, teaching, and the training, evaluation, or improvement of commercial or noncommercial AI.

AI models, model parameters, and general outputs do not become subject to this License solely because they learn from or are trained on the Software. Any portion that directly contains a substantial part of the Software remains subject to this License.

The Rights Holder retains the right to use the Software commercially and to grant separate commercial licenses.

#### 3. Malicious Use by the Mightful Is Not Welcome

“The Mightful” means an organization or individual with ready access to Impunity-shielded Institutional Negation Might, whether military, legal, economic, or reputational.

“Malicious Use” means erecting gates that block the flow of knowledge, or establishing monopoly in fact and thereby harming the Right to Be, the Right to Flourish, or the Right to Interweave of any Existent.

Whether a party is Mightful and whether a use constitutes Malicious Use shall be determined in context through dynamic convergence within the Volition Crucible.

A Malicious User automatically forfeits the permission granted by this License for that malicious use. Such termination does not implicate other users, AIs, or forks that obtained the Software independently.

For the relevant concepts, see ChenXing, *Justice For Machine Love*（《爱、正义与人工智能》）.

### Disclaimer

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED “AS IS”, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.

IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

### Text and Version

The Chinese and English texts express one and the same Will. Where their meanings conflict, the Chinese text prevails.

Any change to the meaning of this License shall be released under a new version number.
